  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VsNs9xP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F411xGo.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EOPNsK1.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftphysicsmod.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6iCc4ux.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1><strong>新版本仅在官方网站提供</strong></h1>\n<p>⠀</p>\n<h3><strong>全新的沉浸式体验</strong></h3>\n<p>探索一个前所未有的全新世界。塌陷的洞穴、交互式布娃娃物理、物品物理以及更多精彩等待着您！\n⠀\n⠀</p>\n<h3><strong>支持的平台</strong></h3>\n<p>Windows、Linux 和 macOS（M1/M2 处理器仅支持 Minecraft 1.20 及以上版本，其他版本需开启兼容模式：<a href=\"https://github.com/haubna/PhysicsMod/issues/461#issuecomment-1332775496\" rel=\"nofollow\">教程</a>）！\n⠀\n⠀</p>\n<h3><strong>生物</strong></h3>\n<p>这是每位物理爱好者的最爱。每个原版 Minecraft 生物都支持布娃娃物理、碎裂效果和方块化形态！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/637/310/172/mob_ragdolls.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/638/310/172/mob_blocky.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/639/310/172/mob_fracturing.png\" alt=\"\">\n⠀\n⠀</p>\n<h3><strong>方块</strong></h3>\n<p>让 Minecraft 世界中的方块碎成碎片吧！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/640/310/172/block_fractured.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/641/310/172/block_particles.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/649/93/310/172/block_voxels.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/642/310/172/block_blocky.png\" alt=\"\">\n⠀\n⠀</p>\n<h3><strong>其他特性</strong></h3>\n<p>受够了物品悬浮在空中吗？试试物品物理吧！重力？月球？火星？冥王星？地球？随你自定义！想让电脑性能达到极限吗？看看在结构坍塌时你的电脑能撑多久！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/643/310/172/custom_gravity.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/644/310/172/item_physics.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/645/310/172/collapsing_structures.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
